      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. can u make it a bit more firm though? like, i want to mention that if it's not fixed by the end of the week i might have to look into rent reduction or something. also, can u add a part about how the temperature is below 18 degrees in the room right now? i want it to sound like i know my rights as a tenant.",
