    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dear [Landlord's Name],\n\nI hope this letter finds you well. I am writing to bring to your attention a pressing issue that requires immediate attention. The radiator in my living room has been broken, and the heating system is not functioning properly. As a result, the temperature in the apartment has dropped significantly, making it quite uncomfortable for me and my family. Currently, the temperature in the room is below 18 degrees, which is not only uncomfortable but also potentially hazardous.\n\nI understand that unexpected issues can arise, but given the current weather conditions, it is crucial that this matter is addressed promptly. I kindly request that you arrange for a professional to inspect and repair the heating system as soon as possible. Your swift action in this matter would be greatly appreciated.\n\nI would also like to mention that if the heating system is not fixed by the end of this week, I may have to consider options such as rent reduction or seeking legal advice to ensure my rights as a tenant are upheld. I hope it does not come to that, as I value our landlord-tenant relationship and would prefer to resolve this matter amicably.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter. I look forward to your prompt response and resolution of the issue.\n\nSincerely,",
